  BUG · INVESTIGATION   ->  templates/BUG-REPORT.md
  FEATURE               ->  templates/FEATURE-REQUEST.md
  REFACTOR · CHORE      ->  templates/CHANGE-REQUEST.md
  una tarea de un lote  ->  templates/TAREA.md

